        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p>Last updated September 3, 2026. This policy explains how NJC Global handles information submitted through this website.</p>
        <section><h2>Information you provide</h2><p>When you contact us or join the community, you may provide your name, organization, email address, phone number, areas of interest, and a message. Only provide information that is necessary for your inquiry.</p></section>
        <section><h2>How information is used</h2><p>Information may be used to respond to inquiries, assess partnership opportunities, deliver requested updates, improve our communications, and maintain the security and operation of the website.</p></section>
