        <section><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may decline optional analytics and request access, correction, or deletion of personal information you previously submitted, subject to applicable obligations.</p></section>
        <section><h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions, email <a class="text-link" href="mailto:info@njcglobal.site">info@njcglobal.site</a>.</p></section>
